## 🛡️ Error Handling

### Duplicate Entry Handling
```javascript
try {
    await db.execute('INSERT INTO ...');
} catch (error) {
    if (error.code === 'ER_DUP_ENTRY') {
        // Skip or fetch existing
        console.log('⚠️ Duplicate entry, skipping...');
    } else {
        throw error;
    }
}
```

### Connection Management
```javascript
async function main() {
    try {
        await seedKelas();
        await seedGuru();
        // ... more seeding
    } catch (error) {
        console.error('❌ Error generating data:', error);
        throw error;
    } finally {
        console.log('\n👋 Done - Database connections managed by pool');
        process.exit(0);
    }
}
```

