## 🎯 Best Practices

### 1. Idempotent Seeding
```javascript
// Handle duplicates gracefully
ON DUPLICATE KEY UPDATE config_value = config_value
```

### 2. Progress Indicators
```javascript
if (count % 1000 === 0) {
    console.log(`   Progress: ${count} records...`);
}
```

### 3. Realistic Data
- Use Indonesian names
- Follow NIS/NIP formats
- Generate realistic email addresses
- Weighted random status distribution

### 4. Transaction Safety
- Not always needed for seeding
- Use for critical multi-table operations
- Pool manages connections automatically

